.TH YARROW 1
.SH NAME
yarrow \- cast a figure
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B yarrow
.RI [ TABLE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Casts six lines with fifty stalks. One stalk is set aside. Each line takes three divisions. The remainder of each division is counted off by fours.
.PP
Prints the lines, top line first.
.B o
marks a yang line that changes.
.B x
marks a yin line that changes.
.PP
Prints the figure, 1 to 64, and the figure it changes to, if any.
.PP
With
.IR TABLE ,
also prints the line of
.IB TABLE .table
for each figure. Tables are in the library.
.SH FILES
/library/outer/*.table, /library/inner/*.table, /library/catalog
.SH SEE ALSO
admit(1)
